 "version": 1,
 "title": "Acid Groove",
 "category": "Drums and grooves",
 "text": "Sound: a full acid-house loop: four-on-the-floor kick, off-beat hats and a squelching acid line on top. It plays by itself; hold a key around C3 to move the bass part's root.\n\nHow it's built: one Clock. Kick on every BEAT; hats on the off-beats from a Sequencer; the acid line from a second Sequencer on sixteenths, through a Slew (slides), a saw and the Ladder filter with RESONANCE high and a short envelope on its CUTOFF. A Delay over the whole mix.\n\nTweak: the bass filter's CUTOFF and RESONANCE (ride them!), the bass steps, TEMPO.",
